{# Fills the caller's `mgmt_state` namespace with the device's management interface: the first
   interface Nautobot marks mgmt_only. The caller sets `vrf` to the platform's fixed management
   VRF, or none when the management interface is in the default routing table; it is not read
   from Nautobot. The platform `_mgmt.j2` partials render it as the interface's VRF line, and the
   service templates use it for `use-vrf` / `routing-instance`. #}
{% for interface in interfaces if interface["mgmt_only"] %}
{% if loop.first %}
{% set mgmt_state.interface = interface["name"] %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
